WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:12.880
Rachel, Hello Louis,

00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:14.880
look at you

00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:24.060
As to finding bodies it's chaos out there

00:00:26.420 --> 00:00:29.640
This house is being requisitioned by the British government.

00:00:34.620 --> 00:00:39.800
Hey Luis. Hello Morgan. Please come inside; this is my wife

00:00:41.840 --> 00:00:47.740
My daughter and I will stay out of your way until we move to the camp

00:00:47.840 --> 00:00:50.620
What if we let them stay warm? You mean, live with him?

00:00:52.040 --> 00:00:55.340
There may not be an outward show of hatred but it is there below the surface

00:00:56.080 --> 00:00:58.380
During the war did you ever hope for a German victory?

00:00:59.240 --> 00:01:03.600
Did the bombing affect the health of you and your family? It affected the health of my wife.

00:01:05.300 --> 00:01:07.300
She died in the firestorm

00:01:08.340 --> 00:01:10.340
I'm so sorry

00:01:14.200 --> 00:01:16.200
You didn't tell me what I was walking into

00:01:16.960 --> 00:01:20.020
This isn't how it was supposed to be. None of this is how it is supposed to be

00:01:20.800 --> 00:01:23.580
Please don't go. I have a job to do

00:01:33.580 --> 00:01:37.860
You're going to spy on a girl the least you could do is pay her a compliment. Yes, of course

00:01:46.760 --> 00:01:49.809
Something's changed, be careful. That's all. They aren't like us

00:02:03.640 --> 00:02:07.540
I never thought that I could be happy like this.

00:02:07.540 --> 00:02:09.920
come with me, this is what you wanted

00:02:15.060 --> 00:02:17.060
To new beginnings

